000100*================================================================
000200* RDLLD  LANDLORD RISK DETAIL
000300*        THE 60-BYTE POL-RISK-DETAIL OF POLREC FOR LINE LLD.
000400*        USED BY RATLLD01.
000500*        policy-admin FILLS THE SAME 60 BYTES IN PRMCOMM
000600*        REQ-RISK-DETAIL WHEN IT CALLS PRMCALC0.
000700*
000800*  UNITS           LETTABLE UNITS
000900*  TENANT-TYPE     P PROFESSIONAL, S STUDENT, B BENEFITS
001000*  RENT-GUARANTEE  Y = RENT GUARANTEE COVER
001100*  HMO             Y = HOUSE IN MULTIPLE OCCUPATION
001200*  VACANT-UNITS    UNITS EMPTY TODAY
001300*================================================================
001400 01  WS-LLD-DETAIL.
001500     05  WS-UNITS                 PIC 9(03).
001600     05  WS-TENANT-TYPE           PIC X(01).
001700     05  WS-RENT-GUARANTEE        PIC X(01).
001800     05  WS-HMO                   PIC X(01).
001900     05  WS-VACANT-UNITS          PIC 9(03).
002000     05  FILLER                  PIC X(51).
